Third-party material in this repository
=======================================

vendor/qjlb-benchmark/
  Official public benchmark of the ADB Quantum Joint-Loss Challenge
  ("joint-loss-baseline" v0.5.0, command `qjlb`; author listed in its pyproject:
  James Edward Ball). Licensed under the Apache License 2.0; see
  vendor/qjlb-benchmark/LICENSE. Included unmodified: every file is byte-identical
  to the official public ZIP and matches vendor/qjlb-benchmark/SHA256SUMS. The
  `.gitignore` entry in SHA256SUMS is absent from the public ZIP and is therefore
  not included.

vendor/qjlb-benchmark/data/seismic.npz, flood.npz and related data files
  Derived from World Bank Central Asia seismic and flood risk Event Loss Tables,
  licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0). Sources, credits and
  changes are listed in vendor/qjlb-benchmark/data/LICENSE.txt.

The Evaluation-Only License in LICENSE applies only to material outside vendor/.
